<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Illinova cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Illinova cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Illinova Corp to netural from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Illinova lost 1-3/8 to 21-3/4 in afternoon trading.</p>
</text>
